<title>UK: Ashanti leaves interim div at $0.125/shr.</title>
<headline>Ashanti leaves interim div at $0.125/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ashanti Goldfields Co Ltd said it set its interim dividend at $0.125 per share, unchanged compared with a year ago.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid on October 22 to shareholders on the regiser on September 1.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
